# Allow-list. This tree is 81,425 files and 2.81 TB, almost all of it agent
# process noise and converted datasets, so everything is ignored and the ~23
# files per trial worth keeping are re-included below.
#
# `!*/` is load-bearing: git does not descend into an ignored directory, so
# without re-including directories first, none of the negations below could ever
# match. Order matters throughout -- last match wins.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!README.md

# Per-trial summaries produced by harbor, not by the agent.
!/reference_stats_*.csv
!/reference_stats_*.md

# What was run, what it cost, and how it ended.
!**/config.json
!**/result.json
!**/trial.log
!**/exception.txt

# The verifier's own record: every metric the analysis reads, which of the six
# tests passed, the reward with the outcome and per-category terms it is the mean
# of, and the pytest output that says *why* a test failed (ctrf.json records only
# that it did).
#
# reward.json superseded reward.txt, which held the pass/fail number alone. The
# reward.txt still tracked for the trials not yet re-verified stays tracked --
# ignoring a path does not untrack it -- and each rerun records its deletion.
!**/verifier/metrics.json
!**/verifier/ctrf.json
!**/verifier/reward.json
!**/verifier/test-stdout.txt

# What the agent produced: its conversion script, its reasoning, and what its
# scripts printed while converting, verifying and training the decoder.
!**/verifier/snapshot/convert_data.py
!**/verifier/snapshot/CONVERSION_NOTES.md
!**/verifier/snapshot/README.md
!**/verifier/snapshot/*_out.txt

# The LLM judges' verdicts and the transcripts behind them.
!**/verifier/judge*/*/DECISIONS.md
!**/verifier/judge*/*/llm_judge_eval.json
!**/verifier/judge*/*/judge_log.txt

# Judge-variability replicates: judges-only reruns of a trial, one directory per
# replicate (judge_variability.md in the main repo). The same three judge files as
# a trial's own verifier/judge*/, plus the replicate's judges-only metrics.json.
!**/judge_replicates/*/judgerep*/metrics.json
!**/judge_replicates/*/judgerep*/judge/*/DECISIONS.md
!**/judge_replicates/*/judgerep*/judge/*/llm_judge_eval.json
!**/judge_replicates/*/judgerep*/judge/*/judge_log.txt

# The agent's step log. The rest of agent/ is 59 GB of terminal recordings,
# sqlite session state and vendored plugin files -- process, not result.
!**/agent/trajectory.json

# Re-ignored after the negations above, because last match wins:
#   *.pkl        symlinks into /nearline, 2.75 TB
#   *.png        regenerable plots
#   cache/       downloaded upstream data
#   *_badtrial*/ runs abandoned as bad; _LAYOUT_GLOBS matches *_trial* so
#                trial_metrics.py never collected them either
#
# agent/*/ ignores every subdirectory of agent/ rather than just its files.
# That matters for speed, not correctness: `!*/` above un-ignores all
# directories so the negations can match, which otherwise makes git descend
# into 72,940 files under agent/{.tmp,skills,sessions,episode-*,command-*}
# and test each one on every status. Ignoring the directories lets git skip
# them whole. trajectory.json is a top-level file under agent/, so it is
# unaffected.
**/*.pkl
**/*.png
**/verifier/snapshot/cache/
**/agent/*/
**/*_badtrial*/
